{
  "id": "Lyo.Sms.Twilio.Postgres",
  "name": "Lyo.Sms.Twilio.Postgres",
  "area": "Communication",
  "tagline": "EF Core PostgreSQL store for Twilio SMS traces: `TwilioSmsDbContext` and `TwilioSmsLogEntity`.",
  "description": "EF Core PostgreSQL store for Twilio SMS traces: `TwilioSmsDbContext` and `TwilioSmsLogEntity`. Complements [`Lyo.Sms.Twilio`](../Lyo.Sms.Twilio/README.md). It never calls Twilio by itself.",
  "features": [],
  "examples": [],
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "title": "`TwilioSmsLogEntity`",
      "text": "`Id` is the Twilio message SID (max 34), not a random GUID. Participant fields: `To`, `From`, `Body`, `MediaUrlsJson`. Outcome: `IsSuccess`, `Message`, `ErrorMessage`, `ElapsedTimeMs`, `Status`, `ErrorCode`. Twilio fields: `NumSegments`, `AccountSid`, `Price` / `PriceUnit`, `Direction` (`MessageDirection`, defaults outbound). `DateCreated` / `DateSent` / `DateUpdated` come from the provider. `CreatedTimestamp` / `UpdatedTimestamp` track the row."
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "`PostgresTwilioSmsOptions`",
      "headers": [
        "Constant",
        "Value"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "`SectionName`",
          "`\"PostgresTwilioSms\"`"
        ],
        [
          "`Schema`",
          "`\"sms\"` (same schema name as [`Lyo.Sms.Postgres`](../Lyo.Sms.Postgres/README.md), different DbContext and tables)"
        ]
      ],
      "trail": "`EnableAutoMigrations` follows [`Lyo.Postgres`](../../../Data/Postgres/Lyo.Postgres/README.md) conventions."
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "title": "Dependency injection",
      "items": [
        "`AddTwilioSmsDbContext(string connectionString)` registers a factory plus a scoped `TwilioSmsDbContext`.",
        "`AddTwilioSmsDbContextFactory(PostgresTwilioSmsOptions)` registers singleton options, `AddDbContextFactory`, and `UseNpgsql` with the `sms.__EFMigrationsHistory` history table (schema `sms`).",
        "`AddTwilioSmsDbContextFactoryFromConfiguration(IConfiguration, section = PostgresTwilioSmsOptions.SectionName)` binds config then registers the factory.",
        "`AddTwilioSmsDbContext` (`Action<DbContextOptionsBuilder>`) registers via `AddDbContext`."
      ]
    }
  ],
